('position-size','stocks','🎯','Position Size & Risk Calculator','Know how many shares to buy so a stop-out costs only the percent you choose.','Decide the percent of your account you accept losing, then enter entry and stop prices. You get share count, dollar risk and reward-to-risk.',1),
